   "pdfText": "After running the script, there will be an instance of Azure Cosmos DB in North Europe that is writable: Yes / After running the script, the Azure Cosmos DB instance in West Europe will be writable: Yes / The cost of the Azure Cosmos DB account is unaffected by running the script: Yes",
