  "stem": "热点\n-\n您有一个名为 Contacts 的 Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL 容器，其配置如下图所示。\n```\nContainer settings: Container id = contacts; Indexing = Automatic; Partition key = /companyID; Unique keys = /familyName,/givenNames\n\nExisting items:\ncompanyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n1 | Rogers | null | rogers@contoso.com\n\nItems to insert:\nItem | companyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | 1 | Rogers | terry john | terryj@contoso.com\n2 | 1 | Rogers | null | rogers2@contoso.com\n3 | 2 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n```\nContacts 包含以下表格中显示的项目。\n您计划向 Contacts 插入以下表格中显示的项目。\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述为真，请选择\"是\"。否则，请选择\"否\"。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "热点\n-\n您有一个名为 Contacts 的 Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL 容器，其配置如下图所示。\n```\nContainer settings: Container id = contacts; Indexing = Automatic; Partition key = /companyID; Unique keys = /familyName,/givenNames\n\nExisting items:\ncompanyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n1 | Rogers | null | rogers@contoso.com\n\nItems to insert:\nItem | companyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | 1 | Rogers | terry john | terryj@contoso.com\n2 | 1 | Rogers | null | rogers2@contoso.com\n3 | 2 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n```\nContacts 包含以下表格中显示的项目。\n您计划向 Contacts 插入以下表格中显示的项目。\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述为真，请选择\"是\"。否则，请选择\"否\"。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "-\nYou have an Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL container named Contacts that is configured as shown in the following exhibit.\n```\nContainer settings: Container id = contacts; Indexing = Automatic; Partition key = /companyID; Unique keys = /familyName,/givenNames\n\nExisting items:\ncompanyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n1 | Rogers | null | rogers@contoso.com\n\nItems to insert:\nItem | companyID | familyName | givenNames | emailAddress\n1 | 1 | Rogers | terry john | terryj@contoso.com\n2 | 1 | Rogers | null | rogers2@contoso.com\n3 | 2 | Rogers | Terry John | terryj@contoso.com\n```\nContacts contains the items shown in the following table.\nTo Contacts, you plan to Insert the items shown in the following table.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 98 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的唯一键（Unique Key）约束。\n分区键（Partition Key）的作用。\n数据插入时的冲突检测机制。\n2. 选项分析\nItem 1 can be inserted:\nItem 1的companyID为1，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为terry john，emailAddress为terryj@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中没有完全匹配familyName=Rogers和givenNames=terry john的记录，因此不会违反唯一键约束。\n分区键/companyID为1，与现有数据匹配，但分区键不影响唯一键约束。\nItem\nItem 2 can be inserted:\nItem 2的companyID为1，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为null，emailAddress为rogers2@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中已经存在familyName=Rogers和givenNames=nul1的记录（第二条记录），因此插入Item 2会违反唯一键约束。\nItem\nItem 3 can be inserted:\nItem 3的companyID为2，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为Terry John，emailAddress为terryj@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中没有完全匹配familyName=Rogers和givenNames=Terry John的记录，因此不会违反唯一键约束。\n分区键/companyID为2，与现有数据不同，分区键不影响唯一键约束。\nItem\n3. 我选的答案\nItem 1 can be inserted: Yes\nItem 2 can be inserted: No\nItem 3 can be inserted: Yes\n4. 官方答案\nItem 1 can be inserted: Yes\nItem 2 can be inserted: No\nItem 3 can be inserted: Yes\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有任何不同，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 98 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的唯一键（Unique Key）约束。\n分区键（Partition Key）的作用。\n数据插入时的冲突检测机制。\n2. 选项分析\nItem 1 can be inserted:\nItem 1的companyID为1，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为terry john，emailAddress为terryj@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中没有完全匹配familyName=Rogers和givenNames=terry john的记录，因此不会违反唯一键约束。\n分区键/companyID为1，与现有数据匹配，但分区键不影响唯一键约束。\nItem\nItem 2 can be inserted:\nItem 2的companyID为1，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为null，emailAddress为rogers2@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中已经存在familyName=Rogers和givenNames=nul1的记录（第二条记录），因此插入Item 2会违反唯一键约束。\nItem\nItem 3 can be inserted:\nItem 3的companyID为2，familyName为Rogers，givenNames为Terry John，emailAddress为terryj@contoso.com。\n根据唯一键约束，唯一键定义为/familyName和/givenNames的组合。现有数据中没有完全匹配familyName=Rogers和givenNames=Terry John的记录，因此不会违反唯一键约束。\n分区键/companyID为2，与现有数据不同，分区键不影响唯一键约束。\nItem\n3. 我选的答案\nItem 1 can be inserted: Yes\nItem 2 can be inserted: No\nItem 3 can be inserted: Yes\n4. 官方答案\nItem 1 can be inserted: Yes\nItem 2 can be inserted: No\nItem 3 can be inserted: Yes\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有任何不同，无需重新思考。",
