  "answerSource": "image",
  "stem": "-\n您有一个名为 db1 的 Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL 数据库。\n您运行以下代码：\n```\nDatabase database = client.GetDatabase(\"db1\");\n\nContainerProperties properties = new ()\n{\n    Id = \"customers\",\n    PartitionKeyPath = \"/customerId\",\n    DefaultTimeToLive = -1\n};\n\nContainer container = await database\n    .CreateContainerAsync(properties);\n```\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述正确，请选择“是”。否则，请选择“否”。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "-\n您有一个名为 db1 的 Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL 数据库。\n您运行以下代码：\n```\nDatabase database = client.GetDatabase(\"db1\");\n\nContainerProperties properties = new ()\n{\n    Id = \"customers\",\n    PartitionKeyPath = \"/customerId\",\n    DefaultTimeToLive = -1\n};\n\nContainer container = await database\n    .CreateContainerAsync(properties);\n```\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述正确，请选择“是”。否则，请选择“否”。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "-\nYou have an Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL database named db1.\nYou run the following code:\n```\nDatabase database = client.GetDatabase(\"db1\");\n\nContainerProperties properties = new ()\n{\n    Id = \"customers\",\n    PartitionKeyPath = \"/customerId\",\n    DefaultTimeToLive = -1\n};\n\nContainer container = await database\n    .CreateContainerAsync(properties);\n```\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statements true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 129 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB 容器的创建与配置，包括分区键和默认 TTL（Time-To-Live）。\nTTL 的行为及其对数据过期的影响。\n分区键的强制性要求。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nItems inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire:\n分析：代码中设置了 DefaultTimeToLive = -1，这表示容器的默认 TTL 被禁用。因此，未设置 TTL 的项不会过期。\n结论：此选项正确。\nAll items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field:\n分析：代码中设置了 PartitionKeyPath = \"/customerId\"，这意味着分区键是基于 customerId 字段的。然而，分区键字段并不是强制要求的，插入数据时可以不包含该字段，但这会导致插入失败。\n结论：此选项错误。\nItems inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days:\n分析：TTL 的单位是秒，而不是天。如果设置 TTL 为 12，则数据会在 12 秒后过期，而不是 12 天。\n结论：此选项错误。\n3. 我的答案\nItems inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire: Yes All items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field: No Items inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days: No 4. 官方答案Items inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire: Yes All items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field: No Items inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days: No 5. 比较与重新思考我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n原因分析：官方答案正确地解释了 TTL 的行为、分区键的要求以及默认 TTL 的设置。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 129 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB 容器的创建与配置，包括分区键和默认 TTL（Time-To-Live）。\nTTL 的行为及其对数据过期的影响。\n分区键的强制性要求。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nItems inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire:\n分析：代码中设置了 DefaultTimeToLive = -1，这表示容器的默认 TTL 被禁用。因此，未设置 TTL 的项不会过期。\n结论：此选项正确。\nAll items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field:\n分析：代码中设置了 PartitionKeyPath = \"/customerId\"，这意味着分区键是基于 customerId 字段的。然而，分区键字段并不是强制要求的，插入数据时可以不包含该字段，但这会导致插入失败。\n结论：此选项错误。\nItems inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days:\n分析：TTL 的单位是秒，而不是天。如果设置 TTL 为 12，则数据会在 12 秒后过期，而不是 12 天。\n结论：此选项错误。\n3. 我的答案\nItems inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire: Yes All items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field: No Items inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days: No 4. 官方答案Items inserted into the customers container without a ttl value will never expire: Yes All items inserted into the customers container must include a customerId field: No Items inserted into the customers container that have a TTL value of 12 will expire in 12 days: No 5. 比较与重新思考我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n原因分析：官方答案正确地解释了 TTL 的行为、分区键的要求以及默认 TTL 的设置。",
