  "answerSource": "text",
  "stem": "容器的设置在 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中配置如下图所示。\n```\nContainer settings (Settings tab; Indexing Policy tab also shown):\nTime to Live: ( ) Off  (•) On (no default)  ( ) On\nGeospatial Configuration: (•) Geography  ( ) Geometry\nPartition key: /productName\n```\n以下哪项描述了容器的配置？",
  "stemZh": "容器的设置在 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中配置如下图所示。\n```\nContainer settings (Settings tab; Indexing Policy tab also shown):\nTime to Live: ( ) Off  (•) On (no default)  ( ) On\nGeospatial Configuration: (•) Geography  ( ) Geometry\nPartition key: /productName\n```\n以下哪项描述了容器的配置？",
  "stemEn": "The settings for a container in an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account are configured as shown in the following exhibit.\n```\nContainer settings (Settings tab; Indexing Policy tab also shown):\nTime to Live: ( ) Off  (•) On (no default)  ( ) On\nGeospatial Configuration: (•) Geography  ( ) Geometry\nPartition key: /productName\n```\nWhich statement describes the configuration of the container?",
  "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的Time to Live (TTL)功能。\n如何配置TTL以及其对数据生命周期的影响。\n2. 选项分析\nA. All items will be deleted after one year.\n错误。题目中TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"，这意味着没有默认的TTL值，只有在单个项目上明确设置TTL值时，项目才会过期。因此，所有项目不会在一年后自动删除。\nB. Items stored in the collection will be retained always, regardless of the items time to live value.\n错误。TTL设置为\"On(no default)\"表示容器支持TTL，但需要在项目级别设置TTL值。如果项目有TTL值，则会过期并被删除，因此不能说所有项目都会始终保留。\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n正确。TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"表示容器支持TTL，但没有默认值。只有在项目级别明确设置TTL值时，项目才会过期并被删除。\nD. All items will be deleted after one hour.\n错误。TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"并没有指定默认的TTL值，因此项目不会在一小时后自动删除，除非单个项目明确设置了TTL值为一小时。\n3. 我的答案\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n4. 官方答案\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有差异，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的Time to Live (TTL)功能。\n如何配置TTL以及其对数据生命周期的影响。\n2. 选项分析\nA. All items will be deleted after one year.\n错误。题目中TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"，这意味着没有默认的TTL值，只有在单个项目上明确设置TTL值时，项目才会过期。因此，所有项目不会在一年后自动删除。\nB. Items stored in the collection will be retained always, regardless of the items time to live value.\n错误。TTL设置为\"On(no default)\"表示容器支持TTL，但需要在项目级别设置TTL值。如果项目有TTL值，则会过期并被删除，因此不能说所有项目都会始终保留。\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n正确。TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"表示容器支持TTL，但没有默认值。只有在项目级别明确设置TTL值时，项目才会过期并被删除。\nD. All items will be deleted after one hour.\n错误。TTL设置为\"On (no default)\"并没有指定默认的TTL值，因此项目不会在一小时后自动删除，除非单个项目明确设置了TTL值为一小时。\n3. 我的答案\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n4. 官方答案\nC. Items stored in the collection will expire only if the item has a time to live value.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有差异，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationEn": "When DefaultTimeToLive is -1 then your Time to Live setting is On (No default)\nTime to Live on a container, if present and the value is set to \"-1\", it is equal to infinity, and items don't expire by default.\nTime to Live on an item:\nThis Property is applicable only if DefaultTimeToLive is present and it is not set to null for the parent container.\nIf present, it overrides the DefaultTimeToLive value of the parent container.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/sql/time-to-live\n当 DefaultTimeToLive 为-1时，您的生存时间设置为开启（无默认值）。\n容器上的生存时间，如果存在且值设置为\"-1\"，则等于无限，项目默认不会过期。\n项目\n此属性仅在 DefaultTimeToLive 存在且父容器未设置为 null 时适用。\n如果存在，它将覆盖父容器的 DefaultTimeToLive 值。\n参考\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/sql/time-to-live",
  "caseStudy": false,
  "answerConfidence": "high",
