  "answerSource": "image",
  "stem": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有三个容器，如下表所示。\n```\nName | Database | Time to Live\ncn1 | db1 | On (no default)\ncn2 | db1 | Off\ncn3 | db1 | On (no default)\n```\n您有以下 Azure 函数：\no一个名为 Fn1 的函数，用于读取 cn1 的更改馈送\n一个名为 Fn2 的函数，用于读取 cn2 的更改馈送\n一个名为 Fn3 的函数，用于读取 cn3 的更改馈送\n您执行了以下操作：\n从 cn1 中删除一个名为 item1 的项。\n更新 cn2 中一个名为 item2 的项。\n对 cn3 中一个名为 item3 的项，将该项的生存时间更新为 3,600 秒。\n对于以下每个陈述，请选择\"是\"如果该陈述为真。否则，选择\"否”。\n注意：每个正确的选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有三个容器，如下表所示。\n```\nName | Database | Time to Live\ncn1 | db1 | On (no default)\ncn2 | db1 | Off\ncn3 | db1 | On (no default)\n```\n您有以下 Azure 函数：\no一个名为 Fn1 的函数，用于读取 cn1 的更改馈送\n一个名为 Fn2 的函数，用于读取 cn2 的更改馈送\n一个名为 Fn3 的函数，用于读取 cn3 的更改馈送\n您执行了以下操作：\n从 cn1 中删除一个名为 item1 的项。\n更新 cn2 中一个名为 item2 的项。\n对 cn3 中一个名为 item3 的项，将该项的生存时间更新为 3,600 秒。\n对于以下每个陈述，请选择\"是\"如果该陈述为真。否则，选择\"否”。\n注意：每个正确的选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have three containers in an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account as shown in the following table.\n```\nName | Database | Time to Live\ncn1 | db1 | On (no default)\ncn2 | db1 | Off\ncn3 | db1 | On (no default)\n```\nYou have the following Azure functions:\n✑ A function named Fn1 that reads the change feed of cn1\n✑ A function named Fn2 that reads the change feed of cn2\n✑ A function named Fn3 that reads the change feed of cn3\nYou perform the following actions:\n✑ Delete an item named item1 from cn1.\n✑ Update an item named item2 in cn2.\n✑ For an item named item3 in cn3, update the item time to live to 3,600 seconds.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 230 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API的Change Feed功能。\nTime to Live (TTL)设置对Change Feed的影响。\n_etag属性的使用\n2. 选项分析\nFn1 will receive item1 from the change feed\n分析：Change Feed仅记录插入和更新操作，不记录删除操作。因此，Fn1不会收到item1的删除事件。\n结论：\nFn2 can check the _etag of item2 to see whether the item is an update or an insert分析：_etag是Azure Cosmos DB中每个文档的系统属性，用于标识文档的版本。通过检查_etag，可以区分更新和插入操作。\n结论：\nFn3 will receive item3 from the change feed\n分析：Change Feed记录插入和更新操作。对于item3，更新了TTL值，这属于更新操作，因此Fn3会收到item3的更新事件。\n结论：\n3. 我选的答案\nFn1 will receive item1 from the change feed: No\nFn2 can check the _etag of item2 to see whether the item is an update or an insert: Yes Fn3 will receive item3 from the change feed: Yes 4. 官方答案Fn3 will receive item3 from the change feed: Yes 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 230 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API的Change Feed功能。\nTime to Live (TTL)设置对Change Feed的影响。\n_etag属性的使用\n2. 选项分析\nFn1 will receive item1 from the change feed\n分析：Change Feed仅记录插入和更新操作，不记录删除操作。因此，Fn1不会收到item1的删除事件。\n结论：\nFn2 can check the _etag of item2 to see whether the item is an update or an insert分析：_etag是Azure Cosmos DB中每个文档的系统属性，用于标识文档的版本。通过检查_etag，可以区分更新和插入操作。\n结论：\nFn3 will receive item3 from the change feed\n分析：Change Feed记录插入和更新操作。对于item3，更新了TTL值，这属于更新操作，因此Fn3会收到item3的更新事件。\n结论：\n3. 我选的答案\nFn1 will receive item1 from the change feed: No\nFn2 can check the _etag of item2 to see whether the item is an update or an insert: Yes Fn3 will receive item3 from the change feed: Yes 4. 官方答案Fn3 will receive item3 from the change feed: Yes 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.230 answer image\n\nBox 1: No -\nAzure Cosmos DB's change feed is a great choice as a central data store in event sourcing architectures where all data ingestion is modeled as writes (no updates or deletes).\nNote: The change feed does not capture deletes. If you delete an item from your container, it is also removed from the change feed. The most common method of handling this is adding a soft marker on the items that are being deleted. You can add a property called \"deleted\" and set it to \"true\" at the time of deletion. This document update will show up in the change feed. You can set a TTL on this item so that it can be automatically deleted later.\nBox 2: No -\nThe _etag format is internal and you should not take dependency on it, because it can change anytime.\nBox 3: Yes -\nChange feed support in Azure Cosmos DB works by listening to an Azure Cosmos container for any changes.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/sql/change-feed-design-patterns https://docs.microsoft.com/en- us/azure/cosmos-db/change-feed 框 1：否 - Azure Cosmos DB的更改馈送是事件溯源架构中作为中央数据存储的绝佳选择，其中所有数据摄取都被建模为写入（没有更新或 删除）。\n注意：更改馈送不会捕获删除。如果您从容器中删除一个项，该项也会从更改馈送中移除。处理此问题的最常见方法是为被删除\n的项添加一个软标记。您可以添加一个名为\"deleted”的属性，并在删除时将其设置为“true\"。此文档更新将显示在更改馈送中。\n您可以为此项设置TTL，以便稍后自动删除。\n框 2：否 -\n_etag 格式是内部的，您不应依赖它，因为它可能随时更改。\n框 3：是 -\nAzure Cosmos DB 中的更改馈送支持通过监听 Azure Cosmos 容器的任何更改来工作。\n参考\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/sql/change-feed-design-patterns https://docs.microsoft.com/en- us/azure/cosmos-db/change-feed",
  "caseStudy": false,
