  "answerSource": "image",
  "stem": "您有一个包含 Azure Cosmos DB for NosQL 帐户的 Azure 订阅。\n您使用以下C#代码定义并实施了加密策略：\n```\nvar taxIdPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/taxId\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Deterministic.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nvar creditCardPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/creditCard\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Randomized.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nawait database.DefineContainer(\"customers\", \"/customerID\")\n    .WithClientEncryptionPolicy()\n    .WithIncludedPath(taxIdPath)\n    .WithIncludedPath(creditCardPath)\n    .Attach()\n.CreateAsync();\n```\n对于以下每个陈述，如果该陈述为真，请选择\"是”，否则选择\"否\"。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您有一个包含 Azure Cosmos DB for NosQL 帐户的 Azure 订阅。\n您使用以下C#代码定义并实施了加密策略：\n```\nvar taxIdPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/taxId\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Deterministic.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nvar creditCardPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/creditCard\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Randomized.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nawait database.DefineContainer(\"customers\", \"/customerID\")\n    .WithClientEncryptionPolicy()\n    .WithIncludedPath(taxIdPath)\n    .WithIncludedPath(creditCardPath)\n    .Attach()\n.CreateAsync();\n```\n对于以下每个陈述，如果该陈述为真，请选择\"是”，否则选择\"否\"。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have an Azure subscription that contains an Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL account.\nYou define and implement an encryption policy by using the following C# code:\n```\nvar taxIdPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/taxId\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Deterministic.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nvar creditCardPath = new ClientEncryptionIncludedPath\n{\n    Path = \"/creditCard\",\n    ClientEncryptionKeyId = \"cek1\",\n    EncryptionType = EncryptionType.Randomized.ToString(),\n    EncryptionAlgorithm = DataEncryptionAlgorithm.AeadAes256CbcHmacSha256\n};\nawait database.DefineContainer(\"customers\", \"/customerID\")\n    .WithClientEncryptionPolicy()\n    .WithIncludedPath(taxIdPath)\n    .WithIncludedPath(creditCardPath)\n    .Attach()\n.CreateAsync();\n```\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true, otherwise select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 236 页答案图\n【说明】PDF 官方答案 text is empty; answer from the answer image.\n\n题目分析与解答\n考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的加密策略和加密类型（Deterministic和Randomized）。\n加密字段的查询能力和加密值的行为特性。\n容器仓\n逐个分析选项\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field:\n分析：\ntaxld字段使用的是Deterministic加密类型，这种加密类型允许对加密字段进行精确匹配查询。\n因此，可以通过taxld字段进行查询。\n结论：\nIf two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value:\n分析：\ncreditCard字段使用的是Randomized加密类型，这种加密类型会为相同的输入生成不同的加密值。\n因此，即使两个客户的creditCard值相同，加密后的值也会不同。\n结论：\nThe Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\n分析：\n根据Azure Cosmos DB的行为，容器的加密策甫在创建时定义，不能在容器已经存在时更新。\n如果容器已经存在，代码不会更新加密策略，而是会抛出错误。\n结论：\n我的答案\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field: Yes If two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value: No The Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\nNo\n官方答案\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field: Yes If two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value: No The Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\nNo\n比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有发现需要重新思考的地方，官方答案是正确的。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 236 页答案图\n【说明】PDF 官方答案 text is empty; answer from the answer image.\n\n题目分析与解答\n考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的加密策略和加密类型（Deterministic和Randomized）。\n加密字段的查询能力和加密值的行为特性。\n容器仓\n逐个分析选项\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field:\n分析：\ntaxld字段使用的是Deterministic加密类型，这种加密类型允许对加密字段进行精确匹配查询。\n因此，可以通过taxld字段进行查询。\n结论：\nIf two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value:\n分析：\ncreditCard字段使用的是Randomized加密类型，这种加密类型会为相同的输入生成不同的加密值。\n因此，即使两个客户的creditCard值相同，加密后的值也会不同。\n结论：\nThe Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\n分析：\n根据Azure Cosmos DB的行为，容器的加密策甫在创建时定义，不能在容器已经存在时更新。\n如果容器已经存在，代码不会更新加密策略，而是会抛出错误。\n结论：\n我的答案\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field: Yes If two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value: No The Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\nNo\n官方答案\nQueries can retrieve items from the Customers container by using the taxId field: Yes If two customers have the same credit card value, the encrypted fields will contain the same value: No The Customers container is created if the container does NOT exist. If the container exists, the policy of the container is updated:\nNo\n比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有发现需要重新思考的地方，官方答案是正确的。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.236 answer image\n[Note] PDF 官方答案 text is empty; answer from the answer image.",
