  "answerSource": "image",
  "stem": "-\n您有两个 Azure Cosmos for NoSQL 容器，分别名为 Container1 和 Container2。\n您计划使用以下方式处理每个容器的更改提要：\n• Container1：Pull model\n• Container2：Change feed processor\n您需要跟踪每个更改提要的当前处理点。\n对于每个容器，您应该使用什么？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。",
  "stemZh": "-\n您有两个 Azure Cosmos for NoSQL 容器，分别名为 Container1 和 Container2。\n您计划使用以下方式处理每个容器的更改提要：\n• Container1：Pull model\n• Container2：Change feed processor\n您需要跟踪每个更改提要的当前处理点。\n对于每个容器，您应该使用什么？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。",
  "stemEn": "-\nYou have two Azure Cosmos for NoSQL containers named Container1 and Container2.\nYou plan to process the change feed for each container by using the following:\n• Container1: Pull model\n• Container2: Change feed processor\nYou need to track the current processing point for each change feed.\nWhat should you use for each container? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 285 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的Change Feed功能。\nPull模型与Change Feed Processor的工作机制。\n如何跟踪当前处理点（处理进度）。\n2. 选项分析\nContainer1: Pull model\nA continuation token: 正确。Pull模型使用continuation token来跟踪当前处理点。每次拉取数据时，continuation token会更新以标记进度。\nA lease in the lease container: 错误。Lease container用于Change Feed Processor模式，而不是Pull模型。\nThe integrated cache: 错误。集成缓存用于提高查询性能，与Change Feed的处理点跟踪无关。\nContainer2: Change feed processor\nA continuation token: 错误。Change Feed Processor使用lease container来跟踪处理点，而不是continuation token。\nA lease in the lease container: 正确。Change Feed Processor会在lease container中存储处理点信息，以便协调多个处理器实例的工作。\nThe integrated cache: 错误。集成缓存与Change Feed的处理点跟踪无关。\n3. 我的答案\nContainer1: A continuation token\nContainer2: A lease in the lease container\n4. 官方答案\nContainer1: A continuation token\nContainer2: A lease in the lease container\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 285 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的Change Feed功能。\nPull模型与Change Feed Processor的工作机制。\n如何跟踪当前处理点（处理进度）。\n2. 选项分析\nContainer1: Pull model\nA continuation token: 正确。Pull模型使用continuation token来跟踪当前处理点。每次拉取数据时，continuation token会更新以标记进度。\nA lease in the lease container: 错误。Lease container用于Change Feed Processor模式，而不是Pull模型。\nThe integrated cache: 错误。集成缓存用于提高查询性能，与Change Feed的处理点跟踪无关。\nContainer2: Change feed processor\nA continuation token: 错误。Change Feed Processor使用lease container来跟踪处理点，而不是continuation token。\nA lease in the lease container: 正确。Change Feed Processor会在lease container中存储处理点信息，以便协调多个处理器实例的工作。\nThe integrated cache: 错误。集成缓存与Change Feed的处理点跟踪无关。\n3. 我的答案\nContainer1: A continuation token\nContainer2: A lease in the lease container\n4. 官方答案\nContainer1: A continuation token\nContainer2: A lease in the lease container\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
