  "stem": "热点 -\n您有如下图所示的索引策略。\n```\nData Explorer: SQL API > Test > families > Settings > Indexing Policy\n{\n  \"indexingMode\":\"consistent\",\n  \"automatic\":true,\n  \"includedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/surname/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/*\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"compositeIndexes\":[\n    [\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/name\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/age\"\n      }\n    ]\n  ]\n}\n```\n使用下拉菜单选择答案选项，根据图形中提供的信息回答每个问题。\n注意：每个正确选择值一分。",
  "stemZh": "热点 -\n您有如下图所示的索引策略。\n```\nData Explorer: SQL API > Test > families > Settings > Indexing Policy\n{\n  \"indexingMode\":\"consistent\",\n  \"automatic\":true,\n  \"includedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/surname/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/*\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"compositeIndexes\":[\n    [\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/name\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/age\"\n      }\n    ]\n  ]\n}\n```\n使用下拉菜单选择答案选项，根据图形中提供的信息回答每个问题。\n注意：每个正确选择值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have the indexing policy shown in the following exhibit.\n```\nData Explorer: SQL API > Test > families > Settings > Indexing Policy\n{\n  \"indexingMode\":\"consistent\",\n  \"automatic\":true,\n  \"includedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/surname/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\":[\n    {\n      \"path\":\"/*\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"compositeIndexes\":[\n    [\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/name\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\":\"/age\"\n      }\n    ]\n  ]\n}\n```\nUse the drop-down menus to select the answer choice that answers each question based on the information presented in the graphic.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 297 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB 索引策略的配置，包括自动索引、路径包含与排除、以及复合索引的使用。\n查询语句中使用 ORDER BY 的限制条件。\n索引更新的时机与索引模式（如 consistent 模式）。\n2. 选项分析\n问题1: When creating a query, which ORDER BY statement will execute successfully?\nORDER BY c.age ASC,c.name ASC:错误。复合索引中定义了路径顺序为/name’和/age’，因此必须按照定义的顺序使用 ORDER BY。\nORDER BY c.age DESC,c.name DESC:错误。同样因为复合索引的路径顺序为\"/name’和 /age'，路径顺序不匹配。\nORDER BY c.name ASC,c.age DESC:错误。复合索引支持的排序方向必须一致（ASC 或 DESC），不能混合使用。\nORDER BY c.name DESC,c.age ASC:错误。排序方向混合使用（DESC 和 ASC），不符合复合索引的要求。\nORDER BY c.name DESC,c.age DESC:正确。复合索引支持路径顺序/name’和/age’，且排序方向一致（DESC）。\n问题2: During the creation of an item, when will the index update?\nNever:错误。索引模式为‘consistent\"，索引会实时更新。\nAt a scheduled interval: 错误。‘consistent 模式下索引更新是实时的，而非定期。\nAt the same time as the item creation: 正确。 consistent 模式确保索引在数据写入时立即更新。\nAfter the item appears in the change feed: 错误。 Change feed 是用于数据变更的订阅机制，与索引更新无关。\n3. 我选的答案\n问题1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\n问题2: At the same time as the item creation\n4. 官方答案\n问题1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\n问题2: At the same time as the item creation\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 297 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB 索引策略的配置，包括自动索引、路径包含与排除、以及复合索引的使用。\n查询语句中使用 ORDER BY 的限制条件。\n索引更新的时机与索引模式（如 consistent 模式）。\n2. 选项分析\n问题1: When creating a query, which ORDER BY statement will execute successfully?\nORDER BY c.age ASC,c.name ASC:错误。复合索引中定义了路径顺序为/name’和/age’，因此必须按照定义的顺序使用 ORDER BY。\nORDER BY c.age DESC,c.name DESC:错误。同样因为复合索引的路径顺序为\"/name’和 /age'，路径顺序不匹配。\nORDER BY c.name ASC,c.age DESC:错误。复合索引支持的排序方向必须一致（ASC 或 DESC），不能混合使用。\nORDER BY c.name DESC,c.age ASC:错误。排序方向混合使用（DESC 和 ASC），不符合复合索引的要求。\nORDER BY c.name DESC,c.age DESC:正确。复合索引支持路径顺序/name’和/age’，且排序方向一致（DESC）。\n问题2: During the creation of an item, when will the index update?\nNever:错误。索引模式为‘consistent\"，索引会实时更新。\nAt a scheduled interval: 错误。‘consistent 模式下索引更新是实时的，而非定期。\nAt the same time as the item creation: 正确。 consistent 模式确保索引在数据写入时立即更新。\nAfter the item appears in the change feed: 错误。 Change feed 是用于数据变更的订阅机制，与索引更新无关。\n3. 我选的答案\n问题1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\n问题2: At the same time as the item creation\n4. 官方答案\n问题1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\n问题2: At the same time as the item creation\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.297 answer image\n\nBox 1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\nQueries that have an ORDER BY clause with two or more properties require a composite index.\nThe following considerations are used when using composite indexes for queries with an ORDER BY clause with two or more properties:\n✑ If the composite index paths do not match the sequence of the properties in the ORDER BY clause, then the composite index can't support the query.\n✑ The order of composite index paths (ascending or descending) should also match the order in the ORDER BY clause.\n✑ The composite index also supports an ORDER BY clause with the opposite order on all paths.\nBox 2: At the same time as the item creation\nAzure Cosmos DB supports two indexing modes:\n✑ Consistent: The index is updated synchronously as you create, update or delete items. This means that the consistency of your read queries will be the consistency configured for the account.\n✑ None: Indexing is disabled on the container.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-policy\n框 1: ORDER BY c.name DESC, c.age DESC\n带有两个或更多属性的 ORDER BY子句的查询需要一个复合索引。\n在使用复合索引处理带有两个或更多属性的 ORDER BY子句的查询时，需要考虑以下事项：\n✑ 如果复合索寧路寽与 ORDER BY 子句中宜嬖的顺寏不匹配，则复合索寧无條支持该查询。\n复合索引路径的顺序（升序或降序）也应与 ORDER BY子句中的顺序匹配。\n复合索引还支持在所有路径上具有相反顺序的 ORDER BY 子句。\n与项目\nAzure Cosmos DB 支持两种索引模式：\n一致性：索引在您创建、更新或删除项目时同步更新。这意味着您的读取查询的一致性将是为账户配置的一致性。\n无：容器上的索引已禁用。\n参考：\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-policy",
