  "stem": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有一个名为 container1 的容器。\n以下是 container1 容器中一个文档的示例。\n```\n{\n  \"studentId\": \"631282\",\n  \"fisrtName\": \"James\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n  \"enrollmentYear\": 1990,\n  \"isActivelyEnrolled\": true,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"stateProvince\": \"\",\n    \"postal\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nIndexing policy:\n{\n  \"indexingMode\": \"consistent\",\n  \"includedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/city/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/firstname/?\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\ncontainer1 容器具有以下索引策略。\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述为真，请选择是。否则，请选择否。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有一个名为 container1 的容器。\n以下是 container1 容器中一个文档的示例。\n```\n{\n  \"studentId\": \"631282\",\n  \"fisrtName\": \"James\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n  \"enrollmentYear\": 1990,\n  \"isActivelyEnrolled\": true,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"stateProvince\": \"\",\n    \"postal\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nIndexing policy:\n{\n  \"indexingMode\": \"consistent\",\n  \"includedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/city/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/firstname/?\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\ncontainer1 容器具有以下索引策略。\n对于以下每个陈述，如果陈述为真，请选择是。否则，请选择否。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have a container named container1 in an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account.\nThe following is a sample of a document in container1.\n```\n{\n  \"studentId\": \"631282\",\n  \"fisrtName\": \"James\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n  \"enrollmentYear\": 1990,\n  \"isActivelyEnrolled\": true,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"\",\n    \"city\": \"\",\n    \"stateProvince\": \"\",\n    \"postal\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nIndexing policy:\n{\n  \"indexingMode\": \"consistent\",\n  \"includedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/city/?\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excludedPaths\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/address/*\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/firstname/?\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\nThe container1 container has the following indexing policy.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 303 页答案图\n\nDP-420考试辅导 - 题目解析\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是Azure Cosmos DB的索引策略（Indexing Policy），包括如何配置包含路径（Included Paths）和排除路径（Excluded Paths）。\n理解索引模式（Indexing Mode）以及如何根据路径规则决定哪些属性会被索引。\n2. 选项分析\nThe /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index根据索引策略，`includedPaths`中包含了`/*`，这意味着所有属性默认都会被索引，除非在`excludedPaths`中明确排除。\n'excludedPaths'中没有排除/isActivelyEnrolled’，因此该属性会被索引。\n正确答案：Yes\nThe /fisrtname property is included in the index\n虽然includedPaths’中包含了/*，但'excludedPaths’明确排除了/firstname/？，这意味着/fisrtname’属性不会被索引。\n正确答案：No\nThe /address/city property is included in the index\n`includedPaths`中明确包含了`/address/city/?`，这意味着`/address/city`属性会被索引。\n尽管\"excludedPaths’中排除了/address/*，但/address/city/?的规则优先级更高，因此该属性仍然会被索引。\n正确答案：Yes\n3. 我选的答案\nThe /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index: Yes The /fisrtname property is included in the index: No The /address/city property is included in the index: Yes 4. 官方答案The /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index: Yes The /fisrtname property is included in the index: No The /address/city property is included in the index: Yes 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有需要重新思考或修正的地方。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 303 页答案图\n\nDP-420考试辅导 - 题目解析\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是Azure Cosmos DB的索引策略（Indexing Policy），包括如何配置包含路径（Included Paths）和排除路径（Excluded Paths）。\n理解索引模式（Indexing Mode）以及如何根据路径规则决定哪些属性会被索引。\n2. 选项分析\nThe /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index根据索引策略，`includedPaths`中包含了`/*`，这意味着所有属性默认都会被索引，除非在`excludedPaths`中明确排除。\n'excludedPaths'中没有排除/isActivelyEnrolled’，因此该属性会被索引。\n正确答案：Yes\nThe /fisrtname property is included in the index\n虽然includedPaths’中包含了/*，但'excludedPaths’明确排除了/firstname/？，这意味着/fisrtname’属性不会被索引。\n正确答案：No\nThe /address/city property is included in the index\n`includedPaths`中明确包含了`/address/city/?`，这意味着`/address/city`属性会被索引。\n尽管\"excludedPaths’中排除了/address/*，但/address/city/?的规则优先级更高，因此该属性仍然会被索引。\n正确答案：Yes\n3. 我选的答案\nThe /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index: Yes The /fisrtname property is included in the index: No The /address/city property is included in the index: Yes 4. 官方答案The /isActivelyEnrolled property is included in the index: Yes The /fisrtname property is included in the index: No The /address/city property is included in the index: Yes 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n没有需要重新思考或修正的地方。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.303 answer image\n\nBox 1: Yes -\n\"path\": \"/*\" is in includePaths.\nInclude the root path to selectively exclude paths that don't need to be indexed. This is the recommended approach as it lets Azure Cosmos DB proactively index any new property that may be added to your model.\nBox 2: No -\n\"path\": \"/firstName/?\" is in excludePaths.\nBox 3: Yes -\n\"path\": \"/address/city/?\" is in includePaths\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-policy\n栽 1：是 -\n\"path\": \"/*\" 在 includePaths 中。\n包含根路径以选择性地排除不需要索引的路径。这是推荐的方法，因为它允许 Azure Cosmos DB 主动索引可能添加到您的模型中\n的任何新属性。\n栽 2：否 -\n\"path\": \"/firstName/?\" 在 excludePaths 中。\n栽 3：是 -\n\"path\": \"/address/city/?\" 在 includePaths 中。\n参考：\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-policy",
