  "stem": "您有一个名为 account1 的 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户。\n您拥有以下表格中显示的 Azure 虚拟网络和子网。\n```\nSubnet | Network | IP address range | Virtual machine\nsubnet1 | vnet1 | 10.0.0.0/24 | VM1\nsubnet2 | vnet1 | 10.0.1.0/24 | VM2\nsubnet3 | vnet2 | 10.1.0.0/24 | VM3\n\naccount1 Firewall and virtual networks settings (screenshot):\nAllow access from: Selected networks\nVirtual networks: vnet1 (address range 10.0.0.0/16) - subnet vnet1.subnet1, address range 10.0.1.0/24, Endpoint Status: Enabled\nFirewall IP (Single IPv4 or CIDR range): (empty)\nExceptions: Accept connections from within public Azure datacenters = unchecked; Allow access from Azure Portal = checked\n```\nvnet1 和 vnet2 网络通过虚拟网络对等连接。\naccount1 的防火墙和虚拟网络设置已按照展示内容进行配置。\n对于以下每个陈述，请选择\"是\"如果陈述为真。否则，选择\"否”。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您有一个名为 account1 的 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户。\n您拥有以下表格中显示的 Azure 虚拟网络和子网。\n```\nSubnet | Network | IP address range | Virtual machine\nsubnet1 | vnet1 | 10.0.0.0/24 | VM1\nsubnet2 | vnet1 | 10.0.1.0/24 | VM2\nsubnet3 | vnet2 | 10.1.0.0/24 | VM3\n\naccount1 Firewall and virtual networks settings (screenshot):\nAllow access from: Selected networks\nVirtual networks: vnet1 (address range 10.0.0.0/16) - subnet vnet1.subnet1, address range 10.0.1.0/24, Endpoint Status: Enabled\nFirewall IP (Single IPv4 or CIDR range): (empty)\nExceptions: Accept connections from within public Azure datacenters = unchecked; Allow access from Azure Portal = checked\n```\nvnet1 和 vnet2 网络通过虚拟网络对等连接。\naccount1 的防火墙和虚拟网络设置已按照展示内容进行配置。\n对于以下每个陈述，请选择\"是\"如果陈述为真。否则，选择\"否”。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You have an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account named account1.\nYou have the Azure virtual networks and subnets shown in the following table.\n```\nSubnet | Network | IP address range | Virtual machine\nsubnet1 | vnet1 | 10.0.0.0/24 | VM1\nsubnet2 | vnet1 | 10.0.1.0/24 | VM2\nsubnet3 | vnet2 | 10.1.0.0/24 | VM3\n\naccount1 Firewall and virtual networks settings (screenshot):\nAllow access from: Selected networks\nVirtual networks: vnet1 (address range 10.0.0.0/16) - subnet vnet1.subnet1, address range 10.0.1.0/24, Endpoint Status: Enabled\nFirewall IP (Single IPv4 or CIDR range): (empty)\nExceptions: Accept connections from within public Azure datacenters = unchecked; Allow access from Azure Portal = checked\n```\nThe vnet1 and vnet2 networks are connected by using a virtual network peer.\nThe Firewall and virtual network settings for account1 are configured as shown in the exhibit.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 388 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的网络安全配置，包括虚拟网络和子网的访问权限。\n虚拟网络对等连接的行为及其对资源访问的影响。\n防火墙和虚拟网络设置如何影响资源访问。\n2. 选项分析\nVM1 can access account 1:\nVM1位于vnet1的subnet1，subnet1的地址范围是10.0.0.0/24。\n根据题目中Azure Cosmos DB的配置，vnet1.subnet1已启用访问权限（√Enabled）。\n因此，VM1可以访问account1。\nVM2 can access account 1:\nVM2位于vnet1的subnet2，subnet2的地址范围是10.0.1.0/24。\n根据题目中Azure Cosmos DB的配置，只有vnet1.subnet1启用了访问权限，vnet1.subnet2未启用访问权限。\n因此，VM2无法访问account1。\nVM3 can access account 1:\nVM3位于vnet2的subnet3，subnet3的地址范围是10.1.0.0/24。\n虽然vnet1和vnet2之间有虚拟网络对等连接，但Azure Cosmos DB的配置中并未启用vnet2的任何子网访问权限。\n因此，VM3无法访问account1。\n3. 我的答案\nVM1 can access account 1: Yes\nVM2 can access account 1: No\nVM3 can access account 1: No\n4. 官方答案\nVM1 can access account 1: Yes\nVM2 can access account 1: No\nVM3 can access account 1: No\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n无需重新思考或调整答案。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 388 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的网络安全配置，包括虚拟网络和子网的访问权限。\n虚拟网络对等连接的行为及其对资源访问的影响。\n防火墙和虚拟网络设置如何影响资源访问。\n2. 选项分析\nVM1 can access account 1:\nVM1位于vnet1的subnet1，subnet1的地址范围是10.0.0.0/24。\n根据题目中Azure Cosmos DB的配置，vnet1.subnet1已启用访问权限（√Enabled）。\n因此，VM1可以访问account1。\nVM2 can access account 1:\nVM2位于vnet1的subnet2，subnet2的地址范围是10.0.1.0/24。\n根据题目中Azure Cosmos DB的配置，只有vnet1.subnet1启用了访问权限，vnet1.subnet2未启用访问权限。\n因此，VM2无法访问account1。\nVM3 can access account 1:\nVM3位于vnet2的subnet3，subnet3的地址范围是10.1.0.0/24。\n虽然vnet1和vnet2之间有虚拟网络对等连接，但Azure Cosmos DB的配置中并未启用vnet2的任何子网访问权限。\n因此，VM3无法访问account1。\n3. 我的答案\nVM1 can access account 1: Yes\nVM2 can access account 1: No\nVM3 can access account 1: No\n4. 官方答案\nVM1 can access account 1: Yes\nVM2 can access account 1: No\nVM3 can access account 1: No\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n无需重新思考或调整答案。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.388 answer image\n\nBox 1: Yes -\nVM1 is on vnet1.subnet1 which has the Endpoint Status enabled.\nBox 2: No -\nOnly virtual network and their subnets added to Azure Cosmos account have access. Their peered VNets cannot access the account until the subnets within peered virtual networks are added to the account.\nBox 3: No -\nOnly virtual network and their subnets added to Azure Cosmos account have access.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/how-to-configure-vnet-service-endpoint\n栽 1：是 -\nVM1位于 vnet1.subnet1，该子网已启用端点状态。\n栽 2：否 -\n只有添加到 Azure Cosmos 帐户的虚拟网络及其子网可以访问。其对等虚拟网络无法访问该帐户，除非将对等虚拟网络中的子网\n添加到该帐户。\n栽 3：否 -\n只有添加到 Azure Cosmos 帐户的虚拟网络及其子网可以访问。\n参考：\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/how-to-configure-vnet-service-endpoint",
