  "answerSource": "text",
  "stem": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有一个数据库。该数据库每两小时备份一次。\n您需要实现一个支持时间点还原的解决方案。\n您应该首先做什么？",
  "stemZh": "您在一个 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户中有一个数据库。该数据库每两小时备份一次。\n您需要实现一个支持时间点还原的解决方案。\n您应该首先做什么？",
  "stemEn": "You have a database in an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account. The database is backed up every two hours.\nYou need to implement a solution that supports point-in-time restore.\nWhat should you do first?",
  "explanation": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure Cosmos DB 的备份与恢复功能，特别是如何实现 Point-in-Time Restore（时间点恢复）。\n重点在于 Continuous Backup 的启用，因为 Point-in-Time Restore 依赖于 Continuous Backup 功能。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n正确。Point-in-Time Restore 功能需要 Continuous Backup（连续备份）作为前提条件。启用 Continuous Backup 后，Azure Cosmos DB 会自动记录所有更改，从而支持恢复到特定时间点。\nB. Configure the Backup & Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Backup & Restore 设置仅用于配置周期性备份，而不是 Continuous Backup。周期性备份无法支持 Point-in-Time Restore。\nC. Create a new account that has a periodic backup policy.\n错误。创建一个新账户并启用周期性备份策略无法满足 Point-in-Time Restore 的需求，因为周期性备份不支持恢复到特定时间点。\nD. Configure the Point In Time Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Point-in-Time Restore 设置无法直接启用，必须先启用 Continuous Backup 才能支持此功能。\n3. 我选的答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n4. 官方答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
  "explanationZh": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure Cosmos DB 的备份与恢复功能，特别是如何实现 Point-in-Time Restore（时间点恢复）。\n重点在于 Continuous Backup 的启用，因为 Point-in-Time Restore 依赖于 Continuous Backup 功能。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n正确。Point-in-Time Restore 功能需要 Continuous Backup（连续备份）作为前提条件。启用 Continuous Backup 后，Azure Cosmos DB 会自动记录所有更改，从而支持恢复到特定时间点。\nB. Configure the Backup & Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Backup & Restore 设置仅用于配置周期性备份，而不是 Continuous Backup。周期性备份无法支持 Point-in-Time Restore。\nC. Create a new account that has a periodic backup policy.\n错误。创建一个新账户并启用周期性备份策略无法满足 Point-in-Time Restore 的需求，因为周期性备份不支持恢复到特定时间点。\nD. Configure the Point In Time Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Point-in-Time Restore 设置无法直接启用，必须先启用 Continuous Backup 才能支持此功能。\n3. 我选的答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n4. 官方答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
  "explanationEn": "题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure Cosmos DB 的备份与恢复功能，特别是如何实现 Point-in-Time Restore（时间点恢复）。\n重点在于 Continuous Backup 的启用，因为 Point-in-Time Restore 依赖于 Continuous Backup 功能。\n2. 选项分析\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n正确。Point-in-Time Restore 功能需要 Continuous Backup（连续备份）作为前提条件。启用 Continuous Backup 后，Azure Cosmos DB 会自动记录所有更改，从而支持恢复到特定时间点。\nB. Configure the Backup & Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Backup & Restore 设置仅用于配置周期性备份，而不是 Continuous Backup。周期性备份无法支持 Point-in-Time Restore。\nC. Create a new account that has a periodic backup policy.\n错误。创建一个新账户并启用周期性备份策略无法满足 Point-in-Time Restore 的需求，因为周期性备份不支持恢复到特定时间点。\nD. Configure the Point In Time Restore settings for the account.\n错误。Point-in-Time Restore 设置无法直接启用，必须先启用 Continuous Backup 才能支持此功能。\n3. 我选的答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n4. 官方答案\nA. Enable Continuous Backup for the account.\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致，没有差异。",
