  "answerSource": "image",
  "stem": "热点 -\n您为 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户配置了备份，如下图所示。\n```\nAzure Cosmos DB account > Settings > Backup & Restore (screenshot):\nBackup Interval: 120 Minute(s) (allowed 60-1440)\nBackup Retention: 12 Hours(s) (allowed 8-720)\nCopies of data retained: By default, Azure Cosmos DB backups 2 copies of data for free.\nBackup storage redundancy: Geo-redundant backup storage (selected); Zone-redundant backup storage; Locally-redundant backup storage\n```\n使用下拉菜单选择答案选项，以完成基于图形中信息的每个陈述。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "热点 -\n您为 Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API 帐户配置了备份，如下图所示。\n```\nAzure Cosmos DB account > Settings > Backup & Restore (screenshot):\nBackup Interval: 120 Minute(s) (allowed 60-1440)\nBackup Retention: 12 Hours(s) (allowed 8-720)\nCopies of data retained: By default, Azure Cosmos DB backups 2 copies of data for free.\nBackup storage redundancy: Geo-redundant backup storage (selected); Zone-redundant backup storage; Locally-redundant backup storage\n```\n使用下拉菜单选择答案选项，以完成基于图形中信息的每个陈述。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You configure a backup for an Azure Cosmos DB Core (SQL) API account as shown in the following exhibit.\n```\nAzure Cosmos DB account > Settings > Backup & Restore (screenshot):\nBackup Interval: 120 Minute(s) (allowed 60-1440)\nBackup Retention: 12 Hours(s) (allowed 8-720)\nCopies of data retained: By default, Azure Cosmos DB backups 2 copies of data for free.\nBackup storage redundancy: Geo-redundant backup storage (selected); Zone-redundant backup storage; Locally-redundant backup storage\n```\nUse the drop-down menus to select the answer choice that completes each statement based on the information presented in the graphic.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 418 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的备份与恢复策略，包括备份间隔、保留时间以及恢复方法。\n理解备份间隔和保留策略如何影响数据保护。\n熟悉Azure Cosmos DB的恢复流程，例如是否需要创建支持票。\n2. 选项分析\n第一部分：The current backup interval and retention policy provide protection for 1hour：错误。根据图中设置，备份间隔为120分钟（2小时），因此无法提供1小时的保护。\n2hours:正确。备份间隔为120分钟（2小时），因此可以提供2小时的保护。\n6hours：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供6小时的保护。\n12hours：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供12小时的保护。\n3days：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供3天的保护。\n第二部分：In case of emergency, you must\ncreate a support ticket:正确。根据Azure Cosmos DB的恢复流程，必须通过创建支持票来请求恢复备份。\nuse the Backup & Restore settings:错误。图中未提到可以直接使用Backup & Restore设置进行恢复。\nuse the Point in Time Restore settings: 错误。 Point in Time Restore是另一种恢复机制，但题目未提到此选项适用于当前场景。\n3. 我的答案\n2 hours\ncreate a support ticket\n4. 官方答案\n2 hours\ncreate a support ticket\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n无需重新思考，答案正确。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 418 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的备份与恢复策略，包括备份间隔、保留时间以及恢复方法。\n理解备份间隔和保留策略如何影响数据保护。\n熟悉Azure Cosmos DB的恢复流程，例如是否需要创建支持票。\n2. 选项分析\n第一部分：The current backup interval and retention policy provide protection for 1hour：错误。根据图中设置，备份间隔为120分钟（2小时），因此无法提供1小时的保护。\n2hours:正确。备份间隔为120分钟（2小时），因此可以提供2小时的保护。\n6hours：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供6小时的保护。\n12hours：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供12小时的保护。\n3days：错误。备份间隔为2小时，无法提供3天的保护。\n第二部分：In case of emergency, you must\ncreate a support ticket:正确。根据Azure Cosmos DB的恢复流程，必须通过创建支持票来请求恢复备份。\nuse the Backup & Restore settings:错误。图中未提到可以直接使用Backup & Restore设置进行恢复。\nuse the Point in Time Restore settings: 错误。 Point in Time Restore是另一种恢复机制，但题目未提到此选项适用于当前场景。\n3. 我的答案\n2 hours\ncreate a support ticket\n4. 官方答案\n2 hours\ncreate a support ticket\n5. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n无需重新思考，答案正确。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.418 answer image\n\nBox 1: 2 hours -\nRPO is 2 hours.\nNote: Recovery Point Objective (RPO) is a measure of how frequently you take backups. If a disaster occurs between backups, can you afford to lose five minutes' worth of data updates? Or five hours? Or a full day? RPO represents how fresh recovered data will be. In practice, the RPO indicates the amount of data (updated or created) that will be lost or need to be reentered after an outage.\nBox 2: create a support ticket -\nRequest data restore from a backup\nIf you accidentally delete your database or a container, you can file a support ticket or call the Azure support to restore the data from automatic online backups.\nNote: With Azure Cosmos DB SQL API accounts, you can also maintain your own backups by using one of the following approaches:\nUse Azure Data Factory to move data periodically to a storage of your choice.\nUse Azure Cosmos DB change feed to read data periodically for full backups or for incremental changes, and store it in your own storage.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/configure-periodic-backup-restore\n小时\nRPO 是 2 小时。\n注意：恢复点目标（(RPO）是衡量您进行备份频率的指标。如果灾难发生在备份之间，您能否承受丢失五分钟的数据更新？或者五\n小时？或甑整整一天？RPO 表異恢复甹数据有多新。在实践中，RPO 表異在停机后丢失或轀要迡新输入甹数据迣（更新或创\n建）。\n创建支持票证\n人人\n如果您不小心删除了数据库或容器，可以提交支持票证或联系 Azure 支持以从自动在线备份中恢复数据。\n注意：对于 Azure Cosmos DB SQL API 帐户，您还可以通过以下方法之一维护自己的备份：\n使用 Azure Data Factory 定期将数据移动到您选择的存储。\n使用 Azure Cosmos DB change feed 定期读取数据以进行完整备份或增量更改，并将其存储在您自已的存储中。\n参考\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/configure-periodic-backup-restore",
  "caseStudy": false,
