  "stem": "您需要选择 account2 的容量模式和规模配置以支持计划的更改并满足业务需求。\n您应该选择什么？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您需要选择 account2 的容量模式和规模配置以支持计划的更改并满足业务需求。\n您应该选择什么？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You need to select the capacity mode and scale configuration for account2 to support the planned changes and meet the business requirements.\nWhat should you select? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 518 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的容量模式选择（Provisioned throughput vs Serverless）。\n如何配置吞吐量（Autoscale vs Manual）。\n基于业务需求和性能优化选择正确的配置。\n2. 选项分析\nCapacity mode:\nProvisioned throughput：正确。根据题目要求，loT相关处理的成本需要可预测，而Provisioned throughput允许用户预先分配吞吐量，确保成本的可预测性。\nServerless：错误。Serverless模式按需计费，虽然灵活，但成本不可预测，不符合题目要求。\nScale configuration:\nAutoscale throughput on iotcont1 and iotcont2:错误。虽然Autoscale可以动态调整吞吐量，但此选项仅针对单个容器，而题目要求是跨容器共享吞吐量。\nAutoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers: 正确。 此选项允许在数据库级别启用Autoscale，并在容器之间共享吞吐量，符合题目要求的性能优化和成本预测需求。\nManual throughput on iotcont1 and iotcont2：错误。手动配置吞吐量可能导致性能瓶颈，并且不符合题目要求的性能优化需求。\n3. 我选的答案\nCapacity mode: Provisioned throughput\nScale configuration: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers 4. 官方答案Capacity mode: Provisioned throughput Scale configuration: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 518 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Cosmos DB的容量模式选择（Provisioned throughput vs Serverless）。\n如何配置吞吐量（Autoscale vs Manual）。\n基于业务需求和性能优化选择正确的配置。\n2. 选项分析\nCapacity mode:\nProvisioned throughput：正确。根据题目要求，loT相关处理的成本需要可预测，而Provisioned throughput允许用户预先分配吞吐量，确保成本的可预测性。\nServerless：错误。Serverless模式按需计费，虽然灵活，但成本不可预测，不符合题目要求。\nScale configuration:\nAutoscale throughput on iotcont1 and iotcont2:错误。虽然Autoscale可以动态调整吞吐量，但此选项仅针对单个容器，而题目要求是跨容器共享吞吐量。\nAutoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers: 正确。 此选项允许在数据库级别启用Autoscale，并在容器之间共享吞吐量，符合题目要求的性能优化和成本预测需求。\nManual throughput on iotcont1 and iotcont2：错误。手动配置吞吐量可能导致性能瓶颈，并且不符合题目要求的性能优化需求。\n3. 我选的答案\nCapacity mode: Provisioned throughput\nScale configuration: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers 4. 官方答案Capacity mode: Provisioned throughput Scale configuration: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers 5. 与官方答案比较我的答案与官方答案一致，无需重新思考。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.518 answer image\n\nBox 1: Provisioned throughput -\nProvisioned throughput is best suited for workloads with sustained traffic requiring predictable performance.\nBilling model: Billing is done on a per-hour basis for the RU/s provisioned, regardless of how many RUs were consumed.\nScenario: Ensure that Azure Cosmos DB costs for IoT-related processing are predictable.\nNote: Azure Cosmos DB is available in two different capacity modes: provisioned throughput and serverless. You can perform the exact same database operations in both modes, but the way you get billed for these operations is radically different.\nBox 2: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers\nYou can enable autoscale on a single container, or provision autoscale throughput on a database and share it among all the containers in the database.\nCost-effective: Autoscale helps optimize your RU/s usage and cost usage by scaling down when not in use. You only pay for the resources that your workloads need on a per-hour basis.\nIncorrect: cannot autoscale on two containers.\nNote: Autoscale provisioned throughput in Azure Cosmos DB allows you to scale the throughput (RU/s) of your database or container automatically and instantly.\nReference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/throughput-serverless https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos- db/sql/how-to-provision-autoscale-throughput 框 1: Provisioned throughput - Provisioned throughput 最适合需要可预测性能的持续流量工作负载。\n计费模式：计费是基于每小时为配置的 RU/s，无论消耗了多少 RU。\n场景：确保与 loT 相关的处理的 Azure Cosmos DB 成本是可预测的。\n注意：Azure Cosmos DB 提供两种不同的容量模式：provisioned throughput 和 serverless。您可以在两种模式下执行完全相同的\n数据库操作，但这些操作的计费方式完全不同。\n2: Autoscale throughput on iotdb and throughput sharing across the containers\n您可以在单个容器上启甠 autoscale，或甑在数据库上配甅 autoscale throughput 并在数据库中甹所有容器之间共享。\n成本效益：Autoscale通过在不使用时缩减来帮助优化您的 RU/s 使用和成本使用。您只需按小时支付工作负载所需的资源费用。\n不正确：无法在两个容器上启用 autoscale。\n注意：Azure Cosmos DB 中的 autoscale provisioned throughput 允许您自动且即时地扩展数据库或容器的吞吐量 (RU/s)。\n参考\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/throughput-serverless https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos- db/sql/how-to-provision-autoscale-throughput",
