  "stem": "您需要为 con-product 和 con-productVendor 推荐索引。解决方案必须满足产品目录要求和业务需求。\n您应该为每个容器推荐哪种类型的索引？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemZh": "您需要为 con-product 和 con-productVendor 推荐索引。解决方案必须满足产品目录要求和业务需求。\n您应该为每个容器推荐哪种类型的索引？要回答，请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意：每个正确选择都值一分。",
  "stemEn": "You need to recommend indexes for con-product and con-productVendor. The solution must meet the product catalog requirements and the business requirements.\nWhich type of index should you recommend for each container? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
  "explanation": "【答案来源】PDF 第 541 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题主要考察的是在Azure Cosmos DB中如何选择合适的索引类型以优化查询性能。\n涉及的索引类型包括：Composite Index、Range Index、Spatial Index。\n需要根据业务需求和查询模式选择合适的索引类型。\n2. 选项分析\ncon-product:\nComposite on con-productVendor and id: Composite索引适用于需要同时查询多个字段的场景，但题目没有明确提到需要同时查询con-productVendor和id字段，因此不适合。\nRange on con-productVendor: Range索引适用于范围查询，例如大于、小于等操作。根据题目要求，con-productVendor字段可能需要支持范围查询，因此这是正确的选择。\nSpatial on con-productVendor: Spatial索引适用于地理空间数据查询，而con-productVendor字段并未涉及地理空间数据，因此不适合。\ncon-productVendor:\nComposite in creditRating and yearFounded: Composite索引适用于需要同时查询多个字段的场景。根据题目要求，creditRating和yearFounded字段可能需要同时查询，因此这是正确的选择。\nRange on creditRating: Range索引适用于范围查询，但题目要求可能涉及同时查询creditRating和yearFounded字段，因此单独使用Range索引不适合。\nRange on yearFounded：同上，单独使用Range索引不适合题目要求的场景。\n3. 我的答案\ncon-product: Range on con-productVendor\ncon-productVendor: Composite in creditRating and yearFounded 4. 官方答案con-product: Range on con-productVendor con-productVendor: Composite in creditRating and yearFounded 5. 比较与分析我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
  "explanationZh": "【答案来源】PDF 第 541 页答案图\n\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题主要考察的是在Azure Cosmos DB中如何选择合适的索引类型以优化查询性能。\n涉及的索引类型包括：Composite Index、Range Index、Spatial Index。\n需要根据业务需求和查询模式选择合适的索引类型。\n2. 选项分析\ncon-product:\nComposite on con-productVendor and id: Composite索引适用于需要同时查询多个字段的场景，但题目没有明确提到需要同时查询con-productVendor和id字段，因此不适合。\nRange on con-productVendor: Range索引适用于范围查询，例如大于、小于等操作。根据题目要求，con-productVendor字段可能需要支持范围查询，因此这是正确的选择。\nSpatial on con-productVendor: Spatial索引适用于地理空间数据查询，而con-productVendor字段并未涉及地理空间数据，因此不适合。\ncon-productVendor:\nComposite in creditRating and yearFounded: Composite索引适用于需要同时查询多个字段的场景。根据题目要求，creditRating和yearFounded字段可能需要同时查询，因此这是正确的选择。\nRange on creditRating: Range索引适用于范围查询，但题目要求可能涉及同时查询creditRating和yearFounded字段，因此单独使用Range索引不适合。\nRange on yearFounded：同上，单独使用Range索引不适合题目要求的场景。\n3. 我的答案\ncon-product: Range on con-productVendor\ncon-productVendor: Composite in creditRating and yearFounded 4. 官方答案con-product: Range on con-productVendor con-productVendor: Composite in creditRating and yearFounded 5. 比较与分析我的答案与官方答案一致。\n没有需要重新思考的地方。",
  "explanationEn": "[Answer source] PDF p.541 answer image\n\nBox 1: Range on con-productVendor\nRange index is based on an ordered tree-like structure. The range index type is used for:\nEquality queries:\nSELECT * FROM container c WHERE c.property = 'value'\nSELECT * FROM c WHERE c.property IN (\"value1\", \"value2\", \"value3\")\nNote:\nThe con-product container stores the company's product catalog data. Each document in con-product includes a con- productvendor value. Most queries targeting the data in con-product are in the following format.\nSELECT * FROM con-product p WHERE p.con-productVendor - 'name'\nBox 2: Composite in creditRating and yearFounded\nComposite indexes increase the efficiency when you are performing operations on multiple fields. The composite index type is used for:\nORDER BY queries on multiple properties:\nSELECT * FROM container c ORDER BY c.property1, c.property2\nNote: Most queries targeting the data in the con-productVendor container are in the following format SELECT * FROM con-productVendor pv ORDER BY pv.creditRating, pv.yearFounded Reference:\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-overview\n框 1：范围索引（Range）用于 con-productVendor\n范围索引基于有序的树状结构。范围索引类型用于：\n等值查询：\nSELECT * FROM container c WHERE c.property = 'value'\nSELECT * FROM c WHERE c.property IN (\"value1\", \"value2\", \"value3\")\n注意:\ncon-product 容器存储公司的产品目录数据。_con-product 中的每个文档都包含一个 con-productVendor 值。大多数针对 con-\nproduct 数据的查询格式如下：\nSELECT * FROM con-product p WHERE p.con-productVendor - 'name'\n框 2：复合索引（Composite）用于 creditRating 和 yearFounded\n复合索引在对多个字段执行操作时提高效率。复合索引类型用于：\n对多个属性进行 ORDER BY 查询：\nSELECT * FROM container c ORDER BY c.property1, c.property2\n注意:\n大多数针对 con-productVendor 容器数据的查询格式如下：\nSELECT * FROM con-productVendor pv\nORDER BY pv.creditRating, pv.yearFounded\n参考：\nhttps://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cosmos-db/index-overview",
